{"id":"wb-7-1334","name":"宜宾大观楼","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"大观楼 (宜宾)","text":"大观楼位于中国四川省宜宾市翠屏区西街口，2002年12月27日公布为四川省第六批省级文物保护单位。2013年3月5日列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。\n大观楼始建于明嘉靖年间，原为宜宾城的谯楼，明末城楼毁于战乱，仅存城台。清康熙年间重建城楼，乾隆甲申年（1764年）再次被火焚，次年重建，楼成始名大观楼。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A7%E8%A7%82%E6%A5%BC_(%E5%AE%9C%E5%AE%BE)","revisionId":86590297,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86590297","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/339dacdf8ad5b1e1e9c6e5a7.jpg","title":"Yibin_Daguan_Lou_2014.04.27_17-44-19.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Yibin_Daguan_Lou_2014.04.27_17-44-19.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a9/Yibin_Daguan_Lou_2014.04.27_17-44-19.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"四川省宜宾市大观楼","width":320,"height":213}}